# Python

- **pixi project:** `pixi install`, `pixi run …`, `pixi add …` — lock versions in `pixi.lock`.
- Do not use bare `python` or ad-hoc `pip install` into `$HOME` when a project manager exists.
- **Platform CLIs** (`canfar`, `cadcdata`, `astroai`): image venv at `/opt/astroai/venv/cadc`; in-session bump via `upgrade-cadc-tools.sh`, not project pixi.
- Docs: Context7 MCP or official pixi docs — not invented wrapper commands.
- Type hints on public functions; run project linters when present.
- Jupyter: `astroai kernel register` after env resume when paths change.
